      "reason": "The drafted item (limit-get-links) names no probe step. The over-limit GET /api/links is anchored on probe step s14 of login-over-quota by i-quota-get-links, which is kept."
    },
    {
      "op": "remove_may",
      "id": "limit-post-links",
      "decided_by": "coordinator, delegated by the owner",
