      "decided_by": "coordinator, delegated by the owner",
      "reason": "No probe sends more than ten DELETE requests, so this item cannot be judged; a DELETE status change stays out of scope and is reported. Coordinator decision 4: DELETE /api/links/:code is accepted as is and is named in the window items' text."
